<title>AUSTRIA: Austria October wholesale prices up 1.3 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austria October wholesale prices up 1.3 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN WHOLESALE PRICES    Oct	  Sept	  Oct. 95</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index rise	 0.2	  0.5	     0.0</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr rise		    1.3	  1.1	     1.1</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    104.0	103.8 1	 102.7</p>
<p>NOTES -- previously announced data in brackets.</p>
